{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"smoked_meat","model_identifier":"smoked_meat","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## smoked_meat\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.5..0.5, y -10.0..0.5, z -5.0..5.0 (size 1.0 x 10.5 x 10.0 u = 3 x 30 x 28 cm).\nSmoked meat: four dark, leathery strips of smoked meat hanging from a cord; the middle of the cord is the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.0.\n"},"description":"## smoked_meat\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.5..0.5, y -10.0..0.5, z -5.0..5.0 (size 1.0 x 10.5 x 10.0 u = 3 x 30 x 28 cm).\nSmoked meat: four dark, leathery strips of smoked meat hanging from a cord; the middle of the cord is the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"cord","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.25,-0.5,-5.0],"to":[0.25,0.5,5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22,10,22.5,11.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2,10,12.0,11.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[23,10,23.5,11.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[12,10,22.0,11.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[8,0,8.5,10.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[9,0,9.5,10.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1dd79c00-c366-55fd-b257-1e6006f9a81a"},{"name":"strip_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.5,-8.5,-5.0],"to":[0.5,-0.25,-3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.